This directory holds the XQuest v1.3 game data - the whole game, as released.

Bundled files
-------------
  xquest.gfx    - all sprites (ship, enemies, objects, fonts, gates)
  xquest.enm    - binary enemy definitions
  xquest.fnt    - small in-game status-bar font
  xquest2.fnt   - large Comix menu font
  xquest.snd    - raw 8-bit 11025 Hz mono PCM sound effects
  startpic.pbm  - title-screen planar bitmap (startpic.raw is generated
                  from it at build time by tools/convert_pbm.py)

Not bundled (gitignored)
-------------------------
  *.json                 - this project's own decoded/human-readable
                            dumps from tools/decode_assets.py. Redundant
                            with the binary files above; the compiled
                            engine never reads them.
  config.json/.cfg,
  hiscores.json/.scr      - personal save state, not game content.

To refresh from a newer or different original distribution, run:

    scripts/fetch-assets.sh

That script copies the required files from an adjacent ../xquest/
directory (an original DOS source/binary distribution).

A separate, complete archival copy of the original XQuest distribution
is attached to a dedicated GitHub Release for preservation. See the
repository's Releases page.
